FireUX concept map
Updated: 2026-06-17
Ref: 37fb262f0
Role: map, not canon

Purpose:
Explain FireUX as the platform shape behind the repo.

Scope:
- Core packages.
- Ecosystem packages.
- Extension packages.
- Project app consumers.

Vertical links:
- Parent: fireux-mono.readme
